{
  "version": "0.1",
  "status": "draft, hand-written; needs review by the medical team",
  "_notes": [
    "Purpose: decide whether a free-text requester is clinical staff before any patient data is shown. Used only when the routing KB (rulebook/kb/routing_knowledge_base.json) does not recognise the role.",
    "This is a demo safeguard, not access control. Real deployments authorise by the logged-in user's role (identity provider / hospital directory), never by what someone types.",
    "Matching: lowercase, whole words (English terms also with a plural 's'). German terms of 6+ characters also match as a word prefix (Ärztin, Krankenpflegerin, Familienangehörige); a prefix match covers the whole word. 'patterns' are regular expressions on single words. A non-clinical term inside a longer clinical term or KB role alias (e.g. 'student' in 'medical student', 'family' in 'family doctor') does not count.",
    "Decision (engine/clinical.py): KB role or clinical term or no role -> see the engine docstring. When several role words appear, the first one in the text decides; an explicit non-clinical requester named first is refused.",
    "Generic keywords only; no patient content.",
    "Multilingual (TODO-cite / review by the medical team): clinical_intl / non_clinical_intl hold French, Spanish, Italian, Turkish and Arabic words. Matching is accent-folded (médecin = medecin, kardiyoloğ = kardiyolog; engine/understand.norm_text); terms of 6+ characters also match as a word prefix (Turkish / Romance inflections: doktoru, infirmières); Arabic terms also match with the article/conjunction prefixes (ال, و, ب, ل) and common suffixes (ة, ات, ين).",
    "Specialty / service names (sports medicine, travel clinic, palliative care, ...) count as a clinical requester: a department asking for its own care task. A bare specialty word without a service word ('oncology') does not.",
    "Self-description overrides (engine/clinical.py self_described_non_clinical): a non-clinical term the requester uses about themselves anywhere in the text ('I am a nurse and her neighbour', 'I'm a doctor (I actually deliver pizza)') refuses the request even after a clinical role. Occupations added for this (pizza, courier, ...): TODO-cite."
  ],
  "patterns": {
    "_note": "Single words. Excluded words are checked first (non-clinical or not a person).",
    "clinical": [
      "^[a-zäöüß]{2,}ologist(in)?$",
      "^[a-zäöüß]{2,}iatrist$",
      "^[a-zäöüß]{2,}therapist$",
      "^[a-zäöüß]{2,}(olog(e|in)|iater(in)?)$",
      "^[a-zäöüß]{2,}therapeut(in)?$",
      "^[a-zäöüß]{2,}(mediziner|medizinerin|arzt|ärztin|chirurg|chirurgin)$",
      "^[a-zäöüß]{2,}medizin(er|erin)?$",
      "^[a-z]{3,}ologue(s)?$",
      "^[a-z]{3,}olog[oa]s?$",
      "^[a-z]{3,}iatr[ae]s?$",
      "^[a-z]{3,}(terapeuta|therapeute)s?$",
      "^[a-z]{3,}olog(u|lar|lari|a)?$",
      "^[a-z]{3,}olog(ist|iste|ista)s?$",
      "^[a-z]{3,}yatrist$",
      "^[a-z]{3,}oloji(si|sinden)?$"
    ],
    "exclude": [
      "^(astrologist|astrolog(e|in)|ideologist|ideolog(e|in)|theologist|theolog(e|in)|geologist|geolog(e|in)|biologist|biolog(e|in)|zoologist|zoolog(e|in)|ecologist|ökolog(e|in)|sociologist|soziolog(e|in)|criminologist|kriminolog(e|in)|archaeologist|archäolog(e|in)|meteorologist|meteorolog(e|in)|egyptologist|ägyptolog(e|in)|technologist|technolog(e|in)|futurologist|futurolog(e|in)|seismologist|seismolog(e|in)|musicologist|musikolog(e|in)|philologist|philolog(e|in)|anthropologist|anthropolog(e|in)|mythologist|ornithologist|ornitholog(e|in)|entomologist|entomolog(e|in)|volcanologist|graphologist|grapholog(e|in)|numerologist|numerolog(e|in)|reflexologist|tierarzt|tierärztin|tiermediziner|tiermedizinerin|tiermedizin|tiermediziner|tiermedizinerin|alternativmedizin|naturmedizin|komplementärmedizin|veterinärmedizin|rechtsmedizin|rechtsmediziner|rechtsmedizinerin|astrologue|sociologue|geologue|archeologue|theologue|zoologue|ethnologue|philologue|musicologue|criminologue|ecologue|futurologue|biologo|biologa|geologo|geologa|astrologo|astrologa|sociologo|sociologa|arqueologo|arqueologa|archeologo|archeologa|teologo|teologa|ecologo|ecologa|filologo|filologa|criminologo|criminologa|antropologo|antropologa|meteorologo|meteorologa|zoologo|zoologa|tecnologo|tecnologa|biyolog|jeolog|astrolog|sosyolog|kriminolog|arkeolog|teolog|ekolog|filolog|antropolog|meteorolog|zoolog|teknolog|biologiste|technologiste|biyoloji|jeoloji|sosyoloji|teknoloji|arkeoloji|teoloji|ekoloji|astroloji|kriminoloji|antropoloji|meteoroloji|zooloji|filoloji|ideoloji|metodoloji|terminoloji|kronoloji|mitoloji)$"
    ]
  },
